> A hand-checkable calculation

A time-limit boundary cuts the GAE recurrence while retaining the actual final-state bootstrap: reward1, value.5 and next value4 give advantage4.1 at discount.9. Native task definitions differ from Jolt and Gym.

```{cpp, results="markdown", file="figures/vsim_envs_worked.svg", flags="-std=c++23 -O2 $(pkg-config --cflags --libs datamunge) -lpthread -Wl,-rpath,$(pkg-config --variable=libdir datamunge)"}
#include <dm/dm.hpp>
int main(){std::filesystem::create_directories("build");auto result=dm::rl::returns::NativeGae({1},{.5f},{4},{1},.9f,.95f);std::vector<double>values{result.first[0],1+.9*4-.5};std::print("| coordinate | computed value |\n|---:|---:|\n");for(size_t i=0;i<values.size();++i)std::print("| {} | {:.9f} |\n",i,values[i]);std::vector<double>x(values.size());std::iota(x.begin(),x.end(),0.);double low=std::min(0.,*std::min_element(values.begin(),values.end())),high=std::max(0.,*std::max_element(values.begin(),values.end())),span=std::max(1.,high-low);dm::graphics::RPlot::create().bars(x,values,"computed",{37,99,235}).ylim(low-.05*span,high+.05*span).title("vsim envs worked calculation").size(1000,550).save_svg("build/vsim_envs_worked.svg");}
